# playcric365 STOCK MARKET bot: the paired-hedge commands (/pair, /pairs,
# /delpair, /run, /stoprun, /runs, /runlog) driving Evolution's "Stock
# Market Live" -- acc1 bets UP, acc2 bets DOWN on the same round, so the
# money moves between the two accounts instead of out of them. No signup
# commands here.
#
# ⚠️ NOTHING BELOW THE LOGIN WALL HAS BEEN DRIVEN ON THIS SITE YET. The
# 2026-10-22 mapping pass had no account, and logged out this site's own
# goToCasinoLive() is stubbed to just open the login modal, so the real
# tile-launch handler could not be read. What IS confirmed: the login
# markup (cricmatch's ids, from /append/loginpp), the lobby's starexch-style
# tiles, Baccarat A = data-id 85 / B = 86 under provider "evolution", and
# that Stock Market is NOT in this site's own catalogue -- so the engine
# reaches it the cricmatch way, through Evolution's in-game lobby (open
# Baccarat A -> LOBBY button -> search "Stock Market").
#
# Do this in order, before any real money:
#   1. .venv/bin/python verify_baccarat.py <user> <pass> --url https://playcric365.com/
#      Read-only, places no bets. Confirms login + lobby + the table opens,
#      and prints the table id and the real chip rail.
#   2. .venv/bin/python verify_stockmarket.py <user> <pass> --url https://playcric365.com/
#      Read-only. Confirms the provider-lobby hop actually finds Stock Market.
#   3. /run <pair> 10 1  -- ONE round at the table minimum, then read /runlog.
# Only scale the amount or the rounds after step 3 settles cleanly.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your-playcric365-stockmarket-bot-token-from-botfather
# One id, or several comma-/space-separated ids for multiple master admins:
# MASTER_ADMIN_ID=111111111,222222222
MASTER_ADMIN_ID=your-telegram-user-id

CAPSOLVER_API_KEY=

BOT_MODE=stockmarket
BOT_SITE_URL=https://playcric365.com
ADMINS_FILE=admins.playcric365.stockmarket.json
SETTINGS_FILE=bot_settings.playcric365.stockmarket.json
# Pair credentials + run history. MUST be distinct from every other
# instance's files, same reason as above. (pairs.* holds plaintext
# passwords; both patterns are gitignored.)
PAIRS_FILE=pairs.playcric365.stockmarket.json
PAIR_RUNS_FILE=pair_runs.playcric365.stockmarket.json

# How many /run hedge sessions may execute at once (each drives two
# Chromium browsers). Default 3.
# MAX_CONCURRENT_RUNS=3

# NOTE on sizing: Stock Market Live's table minimum is 10 rupees on every
# site in this family -- start with "/run <pair> 10 1".
